description=District heating. A water intake by a river feeds a boiler house (2x3) that burns wood, coal, propane or petrol; pipes on the ground carry the hot water, pump stations push it further, a heat unit at a house feeds the radiators around it, and they warm the rooms like a fireplace does. Radiators are anybody's to put in; the network is built by the staff of a heat supply organization (Delirium Economy) or by an admin. Requires Delirium Economy. Build 42.
